		"description": "<p>Whether a pirate swinging on a line or a soldier bursting out of a landing pod, breachers are boarders who fight in close quarters and at short ranges best suited to pistols and other handguns. Though this fighting style is also used by back-alley fighters and soldiers in urban warfare, it gets its name from the swashbucklers of old and the pirates who still plunder vessels on space lanes from planet to planet.</p><p><strong>Table: Breacher</strong></p><table border=\"1\"><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.ZXyeZb8wNk2pMZR8]{Sword and Shot} @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.iWxng7Hm79pWzHrM]{Boarder Traditions}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>7th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.UuXLoSapnqA9wG0Z]{Riposte}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>10th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.nNQu7jMRBjnFgGER]{Braced for Impact}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>15th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.bnHKksiLHgea9oZq]{Quick on the Draw}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>18th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.Q2bVCciloVVBC2ip]{Devastating Riposte}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
